[00:00.00]Twinkle, twinkle, little star.|一闪一闪亮晶晶，满天都是小星星。
[00:04.64]I can't reach the stars.|我够不到星星。
[00:07.78]Sweetie, watermelon time.|宝贝，吃西瓜啦。
[00:12.20]So sweet.|好甜呀。
[00:13.94]Eat slowly, my dear.|慢点吃，亲爱的。
[00:17.58]A black seed.|一颗黑籽。
[00:21.62]Look, the big diaper.|你看，好大一块「尿布」。
[00:27.06]It looks like a spoon.|它看起来像把勺子。
[00:30.00]Yes, clever.|是呀，真聪明。
[00:32.58]Wow, a shooting star!|哇，流星！
[00:36.20]Quick, make a wish.|快许个愿。
[00:39.14]I wish I had a little star.|我希望我有一颗小星星。
[00:44.04]Look, a tiny light.|你看，一点小亮光。
[00:46.64]What could it be?|那会是什么呢？
[00:50.22]Let's go and see.|我们去看看吧。
[00:52.68]It glows like a star.|它像星星一样发光。
[00:55.98]This firefly is your own little star.|这只萤火虫就是你自己的小星星。
[01:00.00]Thank you, Little Star.|谢谢你，小星星。
[01:05.44]Good night, Grandma.|晚安，奶奶。
[01:07.68]Good night, my dear.|晚安，亲爱的。
